interview:  
           once i received the application ocde form the DEV , I do        MVN TEST  ---/ run test cases to check any bugs [ fails or pass ] 
                                                                   MVN CLEAN INSTALL ---/ here the old data will be removed only in the target folder and new .jar 
                                                                                          file will be created.
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
work:
     mvn test
     mvn clean install
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

once dev give the pom.xml file : 
                                 uisng     properties        &      dependencies                      we create the artifact 
                                               |                         |
                                         java version               [ group ID ,artifact ID ] 
 ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------  
*very important*
---------------

mvn validate          : check all neccessary files are there present.
mvn complie           : above all execute & convert .java [human readable] --> .class [machine readable ] & also check for  syntax error ✅
mvn test              :  "  &  run test cases [ check any bugs in code & see expected output is getting as written in code ] 
mvn package           :  "  &  artfifact will be created 
mvn install           :  "  &  store the artifact in target folder & local repo [ PC: .m2/repo { because can also use this for another project 
                                                                                                                               which need same dependencies] 
mvn Deploy            :  above all execute & generated artfact .jar will be storing in remote repo like artifactory/nexsus [ it's a repo storing artifacts like github ]
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------



MAVEN :                      Build automation        &        Project Management 
                                  |                                     |
            It helps Complie & Package JAVA Project                It helps in dependencies Management 

why Maven ?

   Usually used for the JAVA projects, we need upto date version of External dependencies 

HEART OF MAVEN :  pom file

  Maven will automatically download the new dependies, paths, everything will be take care by maven itself , known as Project Management tool

  Maven is used to 
                    RUN test
                     Create JAR / WAR file
                     Using plugin can check security vunerability

Download URL :  maven.apache2.org
               bin-> mvn [ env -> env -> system variable -> new MAVEN HOME -> path paste
                         path -> new -> paste path
  check
    CMD: mvn --version
---------------------------------------
              structure:
---------------------------------------
   
   application
   |
   |-pom                 # project object Model
   |-SRC
       |-main 
       |      |-JAVA           # JAVA Source Code
       |      |-resource       # Config file
       |      |-webapps        # webapps
       |
       |-test
            |-JAVA             # Unit Test'S
            |-resource
            |-NIT
            
-------------------------------------------------      

  Local Repo:    Stored on your computer
Central Repo:  default Global repo
 remote Repo:   own created repo for organaization [ prvt repo ]

CENTRAL REPO

Command:  mvn archetype:generate "-Dfilter=org.apache.maven.archetypes:"

maven Cordinate [ GAV ]
   group ID:        domain name.mavne [   ex: abc.com but enter as com.abc.maven ]
Artifact ID:
    Version:         default
    Package:         default

----NOW ARTIFACT CLONED AND MAVEN PROJECT CREATED-----

WHAT WE HAVE POM file ?

             properties
Dependencies Management
                  Build        [ plugin we have to execute specific ]   
 
  # Each phase of project actually execute by maven's Own plugin
  # Add fuctionality to project  # maven Compiler plugin       - java
                                 # surefire plugin             - RUN unit test
                                 # maven-jar-plugin            - package jar file
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
✅sequence:
              
                mvn validate :   checks if all necessary files and project structure are present.
                mvn compile  :   checks for syntax errors and converts aplication code .java ( human readable )  →   .class ( machinereadable )
                mvn test     :   runs test cases to find bugs and verify that the output is as expected.                |
                mvn package  :   create Artifact from .class file                 < ------------------------------------|
                mvn install  :   stores the artifact in both the target/ folder and PC : local Maven repository (.m2/repository).
    
can artifact in remote repo like github :-          

                mvn deploy    :  sends the artifact to a remote repository (like Nexus or Artifactory) so it can be shared.
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


1. MVN COMPILE:   compil#e mvn project
                     here target file get's created, which have  

                                            Target
                                                  |
                                                  |- classes 
                                                  |         |-app.class
                                                  |         
                                                  |-generated-source
                                                  |-maven-stables
 2. MVN TEST:   
          |-surefire-reports
                           |-Test File ------ { can see the file here }

