what contain in the pom.xml file ?

dependencis
plugins
project information :
                           Group ID   :  company name 
                        Artifact ID   :  project name  
                            Version   :  project version (e.g., 1.0.0)
                               Name   :  readable project name
                        Description   :  what the project does
   
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WORK WE DO ONCE THE dev GIVE FILES ?
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. create an server
2. clone application code repo 
3. cd project_name
4. ls [ pom.xml src two files will be ]

5. MVN Validate ( check all required files are there or not )
   MVN Compile  (above will do again and now check any syntax error )

   ls
   target/  { classes generated-sources maven-status }
   cd ..
   
6. MVN Test ( Run test cases)
   MVN package (create artifact with dependency)
   
   ls
   ( artifact-generated )

7. MVN install  ( make sure pom.xml file is here ) 

---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

   

 note:
       now if give MVN clean everything will be gone [ like target folder where artifact will be there ]
                   MVN clean package again artifact will come by deleting old data which as in the target folder 

      
     







     
